  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2101.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish water conservation practices as required by RSA 485:61.\n\nSource. #8353, eff 5-14-05 (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 2101) (formerly Env-Ws 390.01); ss by #10480-A, eff 12-3-13; ss by #14004, eff 6-22-24",
